# Prerequisites

Complete these before starting Phase 1.

## Palette tenant access

- [ ] You can log in at `https://console.spectrocloud.com` (or your dedicated tenant URL)
- [ ] You have (or can create) a **Palette API key**: **User Menu → API Keys → Add New API Key**

```bash
export PALETTE_API_KEY=<your-api-key>
```

## Workstation tooling

```bash
# macOS: brew install curl jq kubectl   |   Ubuntu: sudo apt-get install -y curl jq
curl --version && jq --version && kubectl version --client
```

